{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdoe3HrjasmRHnSiEhJfu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Verdict: passed.** No `retry-guidance.json` written (status is not failed).\n\nEvidence per verification requirement:\n\n- **One inventory, by search** — `grep -rn --include='*.py' -E '\"(changed-files|test-results|verification-result|retry-guidance|execution-history)\"' tests/ orchestration/` returns only single-schema references (`load_schema(\"verification-result\")`, per-stage schema maps of ≤2 names). No collection of schema names survives. `tests/test_story_013_validation.py:251` re-establishes this by AST/JSON walk over `orchestration/ schemas/ tests/ workflows/ prompts/ scripts/ rules/`, asserting the carrier list is exactly `[\"schemas/manifest.json\"]`.\n- **Manifest contents** — `schemas/manifest.json` names the six stems; `ls schemas/` shows exactly those six `*.schema.json` files plus the manifest. `git diff HEAD -- schemas/` is empty, so no shipped schema was edited.\n- **Exact equality preserved** — `tests/test_schema_validator.py:135` and `tests/test_story_004_validation.py:116` both use `==`; `test_the_inventory_assertions_are_still_exact_equality` asserts every `Compare` op in both is `Eq`. Neither was relaxed to a subset.\n- **Both failure directions and the stray file** — mutation tests clone the harness and run the two real inventory tests against it: extra schema file, extra manifest entry, removed file, removed entry, and three stray-file shapes (`README.md`, `notes.json`, `draft.schema.yaml`) all produce non-zero exit; the unmutated control passes.\n- **Central property demonstrated** — `test_adding_a_schema_requires_edits_only_under_schemas` adds a throwaway schema + manifest line, shows both inventory test modules green and the `-k throwaway` parametrized cases actually ran, then `diff -r` of `tests/` against the shipped tree is empty.\n- **Degradation raises** — `shipped_schemas`